Third-party code in COAL
-----------------------

The Ka/Ks (dN/dS) engine, cpp/src/kaks.cpp and kaks.hpp (and the output format in cpp/src/kaks_cli.cpp; the
copies of kaks.cpp and kaks.hpp in packaging/r/coalr/src/coal/), is derived from two programs distributed under
the GNU General Public License, version 3. It is a modified version of their code, not an independent
implementation; the header of cpp/src/kaks.cpp says what was changed (Chloe Newton and Keanu Murati, 2026).

- KaKs_Calculator 2.0 (kakscalculator2 2.0.1, https://github.com/kullrich/kakscalculator2; original project
  https://sourceforge.net/projects/kakscalculator2/). In cpp/src/kaks.cpp: base.cpp (Fisher's exact test, the
  derived output values), NG86.cpp, LWL85.cpp, LPB93.cpp, YN00.cpp, MYN.cpp. In cpp/src/kaks_cli.cpp: KaKs.cpp
  and base.cpp (the header line, the order of the columns and the composite fields of the .kaks output).
  Copyright (C) 2009, Beijing Institute of Genomics of CAS. All rights reserved.
  Authors: Da-Peng Wang and Yu-Bin Zhang (version 2.0), Zhang Zhang (version 1.0), Kristian K Ullrich
  (modified versions 2.0.1, 2.0.2).
  Licence: GNU General Public License, version 3 (the LICENSE file of that project; the same text as COAL's).
  Wang D, Zhang Y, Zhang Z, Zhu J, Yu J (2010) Genomics Proteomics Bioinformatics 8:77-80.

- PAML 4.10 (https://github.com/abacus-gene/paml): yn00.c, "Pairwise estimation of dS and dN by the method of
  Yang & Nielsen (2000 Mol. Biol. Evol. 17:32-43)", and the routines of tools.c it uses.
  Copyright, 1998, Ziheng Yang.
  Licence: GNU General Public License, version 3 (PAML's LICENSE and README).
  Yang Z (2007) Mol Biol Evol 24:1586-1591.

Two further methods of the Ka/Ks engine have files of their own, each a modified version of the code named (the
header of the file says what was changed; Chloe Newton and Keanu Murati, 2026), with copies in
packaging/r/coalr/src/coal/:

- libsequence, as the R package orthologr compiles it into its function gestimator() (orthologr 0.4.3,
  https://github.com/drostlab/orthologr, src/: Comeron95.h, Sites.h, RedundancyCom95.h, SingleSub.h, TwoSubs.h,
  ThreeSubs.h, GranthamWeights.h, Grantham.h, Kimura80.h, Comparisons.h, Sequence.h, gestimator.cpp; libsequence
  itself: https://github.com/molpopgen/libsequence). In cpp/src/kaks_comeron.cpp (the method Comeron).
  Copyright (C) 2003-2009 Kevin Thornton.
  Licence, as each of those files says: "libsequence is free software: you can redistribute it and/or modify it
  under the terms of the GNU General Public License as published by the Free Software Foundation, either
  version 3 of the License, or (at your option) any later version."
  Each file also says: "Modified by Sarah Scharfenberg and Hajk-Georg Drost 2014 to work in orthologr without
  using external libraries from libsequence. All changes are also free under the terms of GNU General Public
  License version 2 of the License, or any later version."
  Comeron JM (1995) J Mol Evol 41:1152-1159.

- seqinr 4.2-44 (R package, https://cran.r-project.org/package=seqinr, https://github.com/lbbe-software/seqinr):
  src/kaks.c (the functions kaks, num, fastlwl, catsite, transf, titv1, titv2, titv3, prefastlwl). In cpp/src/kaks_li.cpp (the method Li).
  kaks.c has no copyright notice of its own. Authors of seqinr (its DESCRIPTION): Delphine Charif [aut], Olivier
  Clerc [ctb], Carolin Frank [ctb], Jean R. Lobry [aut, cph], Anamaria Necsulea [ctb], Leonor Palmeira [ctb],
  Simon Penel [cre], Guy Perriere [ctb]; seqinr's help page of kaks() says: "The C programm implementing this
  method was provided by Manolo Gouy."
  Licence (seqinr's DESCRIPTION): "GPL (>= 2)", the GNU General Public License, version 2 or later.
  Li W-H (1993) J Mol Evol 36:96-99.

GPL version 3 or later, GPL version 2 or later and "GPL (>= 2)" all allow distribution under GPL version 3, which
is COAL's licence (GPL-3.0-only).

None of these programs is included as such; `coal kaks` and `coal dnds` do not run them. The reference outputs
under tests/kaks/golden/ were written by KaKs_Calculator 2.0.1, PAML 4.10.10 yn00, orthologr 0.4.3's gestimator
code (compiled unmodified with the driver benchmarks/kaks/ref/gestimator_ref.cpp) and seqinr 4.2-44's kaks().

